    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mirror mirror, on the wall\u2026\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lauren begins her new job as a junior House Manager at ARO Tech, the world\u2019s leading new-tech company. She is about to uncover the horrifying truth that was never meant to surface. Sneak around the secret sections of ARO Tech facilities, piece together the chilling past, and survive the horrors born from mankind\u2019s arrogance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the facility and learn about it\u2019s secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the premises one section at a time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak past and outwit your enemies\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your phone to control your environment and enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles to proceed to the next locations</p>",
